WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:02.763
A named deputy may still be unable to take

00:00:02.816 --> 00:00:07.394
over Repairing the agreement is not enough the arrangement

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:10.816
must work when someone is absent You may have

00:00:10.882 --> 00:00:13.053
passed a task to a colleague and assumed it

00:00:13.092 --> 00:00:18.750
was covered Without usable access open-action details and explicit

00:00:18.789 --> 00:00:23.197
acceptance the work can remain unowned We will trace

00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:26.540
a complete handover and its separate service interfaces
